                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "\ud83d\udea8 D\u00edaz-Canel keeps F\u00e9lix Navarro incommunicado and in grave danger. No one has been able to speak with him since he called his wife, Sonia, on Monday morning and said his health was deteriorating and he felt like he was dying.\n\nSonia went to the prison but was not allowed to see him. She has been calling all day for an update, but no one is answering.\n\nThe Cuban regime is punishing F\u00e9lix for leading PPD-PLB and @CubaDecide \u2014 and they may end up killing him. \n\nD\u00edaz-Canel and Ra\u00fal Castro are RESPONSABLE for bringing F\u00e9lix to the brink of death.\n\nF\u00e9lix Navarro must be IMMEDIATELY released and transferred to a hospital. \n\nWe are watching, and we will hold D\u00edaz-Canel and all Cuban dictators accountable for their crimes.\n\n#cubalibre #FreeFelixNavarro \n@RosaMariaPaya",
